rule halves v1
description "A row that asks for a sum of 3 and a difference of 0: real numbers reach it, whole numbers do not, so rulec cannot say over ranges whether the row is reached"

enum kind = odd_half | other

inputs
  first  : number  range >=0 <=3
  second : number  range >=0 <=3

outputs
  answer : kind

derive total : number = first + second  range >=0 <=6
derive gap   : number = first - second  range >=-3 <=3

table t
policy first
| total | gap | -> answer : kind |
| 3     | 0   | odd_half         |
| -     | -   | other            |
